WEBVTT

00:12:26.909 --> 00:12:32.180
and what you see is more of a defensive,
rigid, reactionary strain,

00:12:32.204 --> 00:12:34.401
which led to Arab socialism,
Arab nationalism

00:12:34.425 --> 00:12:36.647
and ultimately to the Islamist ideology.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.168
And when the colonial period ended,

00:12:40.192 --> 00:12:44.845
what you had in place of that
was generally secular dictators,

00:12:44.869 --> 00:12:46.490
which say they're a country,

00:12:46.514 --> 00:12:48.567
but did not bring
democracy to the country,

00:12:48.591 --> 00:12:50.469
and established their own dictatorship.

00:12:50.493 --> 00:12:53.956
And I think the West,
at least some powers in the West,

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:55.508
particularly the United States,

00:12:55.532 --> 00:12:58.195
made the mistake of supporting
those secular dictators,

00:12:58.219 --> 00:13:01.479
thinking that they were more
helpful for their interests.